<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8838" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cōcȳtus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-ŏs</span></b> ), i,
			m., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κωκυτὀς</span> [river of
		lamentation, from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κωκὐω</span>, to howl,
		weep], <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a mythic
				river in the Lower World</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic. Tusc.
				1, 5, 10</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. N. D. 3, 17, 43</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Verg. G. 3,
				38</span></i>; <i><span class="en">4, 479</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. A. 6,
				132</span></i>; <i><span class="en">6, 297</span></i>; <i><span class="en">6, 323</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Hor. C.
				2, 14, 18 al.</span></i>; acc. Gr. Cocyton,
					<i><span class="en">Claud. Rapt. Pros. 2, 353</span></i>; cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Heyne,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg. A.
				6</span></i>
			 Excurs. IX.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Adj.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Cōcȳtĭus</span></b> , a,
			um, <i>of Cocytus</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aqua,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Petr. 120, 69</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">and Cocytia aequora,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Claud. in Rufin. 2, 471</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">virgo, i. e. Alecto,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 7, 479</span></i>
			.</div>
